; A vowel's level. Five cards a frame in: snd, V and u, and its segment's kind and s; per frame two modes and factors
; out for two mulx machines. A sounding, voiced vowel frame: 708 / 1000 (3 dB down) if the vowel is unstressed, then
; less 30 u / 1000 (it falls off across the vowel). Otherwise mode 0 for both.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            frm     INP   snd      a frame: is it a sounding, voiced vowel's
  04                    INP   v
  05                    INP   u
  06                    INP   kind
  07                    INP   s
  08                    CLA   z
  09                    STO   md2
  10                    STO   md3
  11                    STO   y3
  12                    CLA   kind
  13                    SUB   n2
  14                    TAC   vow
  15                    JMP   m2
  16            vow     CLA   snd
  17                    SUB   00
  18                    TAC   m2
  19                    SUB   00
  20                    TAC   on
  21                    JMP   m2
  22            on      CLA   v
  23                    SUB   00
  24                    TAC   m2
  25                    CLA   n2
  26                    STO   md3
  27                    CLA   u
  28                    ADD   u
  29                    ADD   u
  30                    SFT   10
  31                    STO   y3
  32                    CLA   s
  33                    SUB   00
  34                    TAC   un
  35                    JMP   m2
  36            un      CLA   00
  37                    STO   md2
  38            m2      OUT   md2
  39            y2      OUT   c708
  40            m3      OUT   md3
  41            oy3     OUT   y3
  42                    JMP   frm
  43            kind    DATA  0
  44            s       DATA  0
  45            snd     DATA  0
  46            v       DATA  0
  47            u       DATA  0
  48            md2     DATA  0
  49            md3     DATA  0
  50            y3      DATA  0
  51            z       DATA  0
  52            n2      DATA  2
  53            c708    DATA  708
